! BeamLBA experimental export helper - execute in an ISOLATED scratch session.
! Copy matching, preserved buckling file.full and file.mode into that directory.
! Does not SOLVE, RESUME, change KEYOPTs, or modify the original Mechanical model.
! The analysis stage and interpretation MUST be established by native parity.
! In the appropriate buckling FULL file, MASS stores stress stiffness, NOT mass.
! WRFULL is deliberately absent: it is unsupported in linear perturbation.
! See docs/ANSYS_INTEGRATION.md. This macro has not been run in licensed ANSYS.

*SMAT,BLK,D,IMPORT,FULL,file.full,STIFF
*SMAT,BLG,D,IMPORT,FULL,file.full,MASS
*EXPORT,BLK,MMF,bl_k.mtx
*EXPORT,BLG,MMF,bl_g.mtx

! MODE vectors are internal-order, not solver-order. Transform before exporting.
! Do not export NOD2SOLV directly: *EXPORT does not support that source matrix.
*SMAT,BLMAP,D,IMPORT,FULL,file.full,NOD2SOLV
*DMAT,BLPHI,D,IMPORT,MODE,file.mode
*MULT,BLMAP,,BLPHI,,BLPS
*EXPORT,BLPS,MMF,bl_native.mtx

! Associate columns with the actual signed native buckling multipliers.
! This helper does NOT extract member element matrices, resolve element/solver
! transformations, or invent missing native multipliers. Those are release gates.
